This licence covers the CODE in this repository: the pipeline, the models, the
page builders and the tests.

It does not grant rights to the DATA the pipeline reads, which belongs to its
sources and is governed by their terms:

  * CollegeFootballData.com — schedules, results, official season totals, SP+
    ratings and betting lines. Raw feed data is never committed or republished
    here; the site publishes derived aggregates and this project's own model
    output, which CFBD's terms expressly permit.
  * cfbfastR — play-by-play, loaded from its public data repository.
  * Wikipedia — team recruiting-class rankings, CC BY-SA, attributed on the
    pages that use them.

Team names, marks and colours are the property of their respective
institutions and are used here only to identify the teams being analysed.
